# Labels on the printer: the item labels of every item, then the bin
# labels of every location.  The print jobs are compared with
# TEST/GOLDEN/PRT/PRN2.PRN, which TEST/T_PRN.SH also checks against what
# reaches the printer port on MS-DOS 3.10.
#@ PRN
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-R
T T
K PGDN STAB SPACE CTRL-S
S ILABELS
K ESC ALT-R
T B
K PGDN STAB SPACE CTRL-S
S BLABELS
K ESC
K F3
T Y
